Subject: Load Supertonic from its approved Space commit

Freecut MIT adaptation. The Supertonic model files and voice styles are
requested from the Hugging Face Space commit the owner approved
(`model:supertonic-3` in studio/rights-approval.json), never from the
moving `main` branch, so each download matches its reviewed row and
recorded byte digests.

